---

<BaseLayout
  title="指導學生｜王雅萍 Ong Nga Ping"
  description="國立政治大學王雅萍副教授論文指導與學生研究成果"
>
  <main class="supervision-page">

    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">
        THESIS SUPERVISION
      </p>

      <h1>
        <span data-lang="zh">
          指導學生
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          Student Supervision
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="intro">
        <span data-lang="zh">
          王雅萍教授歷年指導的學生研究，
          涵蓋原住民族教育、族語復振、文化與工藝傳承、
          族群認同、土地、部落產業、地方社會、
          民俗與文化變遷等多元議題。
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          Student research supervised by Ong Nga Ping spans
          Indigenous education, language revitalization,
          cultural and craft transmission, ethnic identity,
          land, community industries, local society,
          folk culture, and cultural transformation.
        </span>
      </p>
    </header>


    <!-- 近期指導 -->

    <section>
      <p class="section-label">
        RECENT SUPERVISION
      </p>

      <h2>
        <span data-lang="zh">
          近期指導學生
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          Recent Supervision
        </span>
      </h2>

      <div class="student-list">
        {
          recentStudents.map((student) => (
            <article class="student-item">

              <div class="student-meta">
                <span class="year">
                  {student.year}
                </span>

                <span class="degree">
                  <span data-lang="zh">
                    {student.degreeZh}
                  </span>

                  <span data-lang="en">
                    {student.degreeEn}
                  </span>
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="student-content">

                <p class="student-name">
                  <span data-lang="zh">
                    {student.studentZh}
                  </span>

                  <span data-lang="en">
                    {student.studentEn}
                  </span>
                </p>

                <h3>
                  <span data-lang="zh">
                    {student.titleZh}
                  </span>

                  <span data-lang="en">
                    {student.titleEn}
                  </span>
                </h3>

                <p class="advisor">
                  <span data-lang="zh">
                    {student.roleZh}
                  </span>

                  <span data-lang="en">
                    {student.roleEn}
                  </span>
                </p>

                <a
                  class="thesis-link"
                  href={student.url}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  <span data-lang="zh">
                    查看論文資料 ↗
                  </span>

                  <span data-lang="en">
                    View Thesis ↗
                  </span>
                </a>

              </div>

            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- 歷年代表性指導 -->

    <section>
      <p class="section-label">
        SELECTED EARLIER SUPERVISION
      </p>

      <h2>
        <span data-lang="zh">
          歷年代表性指導
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          Selected Earlier Supervision
        </span>
      </h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        <span data-lang="zh">
          除近期研究外，王雅萍教授長期指導原住民族教育、
          語言、文化復振與民族學相關研究。
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          Earlier supervision also reflects long-term research
          interests in Indigenous education, language,
          cultural revitalization, and ethnology.
        </span>
      </p>

      <div class="earlier-grid">
        {
          earlierStudents.map((student) => (
            <a
              class="earlier-card"
              href={student.url}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >

              <div class="card-top">
                <span class="year">
                  {student.year}
                </span>

                <span class="arrow">
                  ↗
                </span>
              </div>

              <p class="student-name">
                <span data-lang="zh">
                  {student.studentZh}
                </span>

                <span data-lang="en">
                  {student.studentEn}
                </span>
              </p>

              <p class="card-degree">
                <span data-lang="zh">
                  {student.degreeZh}
                </span>

                <span data-lang="en">
                  {student.degreeEn}
                </span>
              </p>

              <h3>
                <span data-lang="zh">
                  {student.titleZh}
                </span>

                <span data-lang="en">
                  {student.titleEn}
                </span>
              </h3>

            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- 研究主題 -->

    <section>
      <p class="section-label">
        RESEARCH THEMES
      </p>

      <h2>
        <span data-lang="zh">
          學生研究主題
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          Student Research Themes
        </span>
      </h2>

      <div class="theme-grid">

        <div class="theme">
          <span>01</span>

          <h3>
            <span data-lang="zh">
              原住民族教育
            </span>

            <span data-lang="en">
              Indigenous Education
            </span>
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="theme">
          <span>02</span>

          <h3>
            <span data-lang="zh">
              族語與文化復振
            </span>

            <span data-lang="en">
              Language & Cultural Revitalization
            </span>
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="theme">
          <span>03</span>

          <h3>
            <span data-lang="zh">
              部落與地方社會
            </span>

            <span data-lang="en">
              Communities & Local Society
            </span>
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="theme">
          <span>04</span>

          <h3>
            <span data-lang="zh">
              族群認同與文化
            </span>

            <span data-lang="en">
              Ethnic Identity & Culture
            </span>
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="theme">
          <span>05</span>

          <h3>
            <span data-lang="zh">
              土地與部落產業
            </span>

            <span data-lang="en">
              Land & Indigenous Economies
            </span>
          </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="theme">
          <span>06</span>

          <h3>
            <span data-lang="zh">
              民俗與社會變遷
            </span>

            <span data-lang="en">
              Folk Culture & Social Change
            </span>
          </h3>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- 完整資料 -->

    <section class="official-section">
      <p class="section-label">
        OFFICIAL RECORD
      </p>

      <h2>
        <span data-lang="zh">
          完整論文指導紀錄
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          Complete Supervision Record
        </span>
      </h2>

      <p>
        <span data-lang="zh">
          政大 Academic Hub 收錄王雅萍教授完整的
          碩、博士論文指導紀錄；最新資料請以官方系統為準。
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          NCCU Academic Hub maintains the complete record
          of master's and doctoral theses supervised by Ong Nga Ping.
        </span>
      </p>

      <div class="official-buttons">

        <a
          href="https://ah.lib.nccu.edu.tw/scholar?id=350&subtitle=advisor&title=university"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          <span data-lang="zh">
            Academic Hub 指導紀錄 ↗
          </span>

          <span data-lang="en">
            Academic Hub Record ↗
          </span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://thesis.lib.nccu.edu.tw/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          <span data-lang="zh">
            政大博碩士論文系統 ↗
          </span>

          <span data-lang="en">
            NCCU Thesis Database ↗
          </span>
        </a>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>


<style>
  .supervision-page {
    width: min(1080px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin: 0 auto;

    padding: 100px 0 130px;
  }


  /* HEADER */

  .page-header {
    max-width: 850px;

    padding-bottom: 90px;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .section-label {
    margin: 0 0 14px;

    color: var(--brown);

    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;

    color: var(--text);

    font-size: clamp(52px, 8vw, 88px);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 800px;

    margin: 36px 0 0;

    color: var(--text-secondary);

    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }


  /* SECTION */

  section {
    padding: 64px 0;

    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 8px 0 42px;

    color: var(--text);

    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 40px);
  }

  .section-intro {
    max-width: 760px;

    margin: -15px 0 40px;

    color: var(--text-secondary);

    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }


  /* STUDENT LIST */

  .student-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .student-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr;

    gap: 40px;

    padding: 34px 0;

    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .student-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;

    gap: 12px;
  }

  .year {
    color: var(--brown);

    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .degree {
    padding: 5px 10px;

    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 999px;

    color: var(--green);

    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .student-name {
    margin: 0 0 9px;

    color: var(--green);

    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .student-content h3 {
    max-width: 800px;

    margin: 0;

    color: var(--text);

    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .advisor {
    margin: 13px 0 0;

    color: var(--text-secondary);

    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .thesis-link {
    display: inline-block;

    margin-top: 16px;

    color: var(--green);

    text-decoration: none;

    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .thesis-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }


  /* EARLIER */

  .earlier-grid {
    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);

    gap: 20px;
  }

  .earlier-card {
    min-height: 300px;

    display: block;

    padding: 28px;

    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;

    color: var(--text);

    text-decoration: none;

    transition:
      border-color 0.2s ease,
      background 0.2s ease,
      transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .earlier-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--green);

    background: rgba(47, 102, 82, 0.04);

    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .card-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;

    margin-bottom: 35px;
  }

  .arrow {
    color: var(--green);

    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .card-degree {
    margin: 0 0 15px;

    color: var(--text-secondary);

    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .earlier-card h3 {
    margin: 0;

    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }


  /* THEMES */

  .theme-grid {
    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);

    gap: 16px;
  }

  .theme {
    min-height: 150px;

    padding: 24px;

    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
  }

  .theme > span {
    color: var(--brown);

    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .theme h3 {
    margin: 35px 0 0;

    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }


  /* OFFICIAL */

  .official-section p {
    max-width: 760px;

    color: var(--text-secondary);

    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .official-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;

    gap: 12px;

    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .official-buttons a {
    padding: 13px 20px;

    border: 1px solid var(--green);
    border-radius: 999px;

    color: var(--green);

    text-decoration: none;

    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;

    transition:
      background 0.2s ease,
      color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .official-buttons a:hover {
    background: var(--green);

    color: var(--background);
  }


  /* TABLET */

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .earlier-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .theme-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }


  /* MOBILE */

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .supervision-page {
      width: calc(100% - 40px);

      padding: 60px 0 80px;
    }

    .page-header {
      padding-bottom: 60px;
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    section {
      padding: 45px 0;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .student-item {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;

      gap: 18px;

      padding: 27px 0;
    }

    .student-meta {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .student-content h3 {
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .earlier-card {
      min-height: auto;

      padding: 24px;
    }

    .theme-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .theme {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .official-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>